      "quote": "+----------------------+-------------------------------------------+ | Attribute            | Value                                     | +----------------------+-------------------------------------------+ | Address Block        | 2001:1::2/128                             | | Name                 | Traversal Using Relays around NAT Anycast | | RFC                  | RFC 8155                                  | | Allocation Date      | 2017-02                                   | | Termination Date     | N/A                                       | | Source               | True                                      | | Destination          | True                                      | | Forwardable          | True                                      | | Global               | True                                      | | Reserved-by-Protocol | False                                     | +----------------------+-------------------------------------------+",
      "source": "quic/s2n-quic-core/src/inet/ipv6.rs",
