      "quote": "An endpoint MUST ensure that every Stateless Reset that it sends is smaller than the packet that triggered it, unless it maintains state sufficient to prevent looping.",
      "source": "quic/s2n-quic-core/src/packet/stateless_reset.rs",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9000",
