    },
    {
      "id": "11cc2c049fc8f475",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 652,
      "quote": "*  MAY ignore the acknowledgment delay for Initial packets, since",
      "source": "quic/s2n-quic-core/src/recovery/rtt_estimator.rs",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9002",
      "target_section": "section-5.3",
      "type": "TEST"
    },
    {
      "id": "69092c005929e694",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 688,
      "quote": "The persistent congestion duration is computed as follows: (smoothed_rtt + max(4*rttvar, kGranularity) + max_ack_delay) * kPersistentCongestionThreshold",
      "source": "quic/s2n-quic-core/src/recovery/rtt_estimator.rs",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9002",
      "target_section": "section-7.6.1",
      "type": "TEST"
    },
    {
      "id": "a950ee1ce762bfdd",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 713,
      "quote": "The RECOMMENDED value for kPersistentCongestionThreshold is 3, which results in behavior that is approximately equivalent to a TCP sender declaring an RTO after two TLPs.",
      "source": "quic/s2n-quic-core/src/recovery/rtt_estimator.rs",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9002",
      "target_section": "section-7.6.1",
      "type": "TEST"
    },
    {
      "id": "0080620a0a2a1a14",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 756,
      "quote": "Endpoints SHOULD set the min_rtt to the newest RTT sample after persistent congestion is established.",
      "source": "quic/s2n-quic-core/src/recovery/rtt_estimator.rs",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9002",
      "target_section": "section-5.2",
      "type": "TEST"
    },
    {
      "id": "57c27658044ffcd3",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 764,
      "quote": "The PTO period MUST be at least kGranularity, to avoid the timer expiring immediately.",
      "source": "quic/s2n-quic-core/src/recovery/rtt_estimator.rs",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9002",
      "target_section": "section-6.2.1",
      "type": "TEST"
    },
    {
      "id": "82240dd2d9c53533",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 816,
      "quote": "The RECOMMENDED time threshold (kTimeThreshold), expressed as an RTT multiplier, is 9/8.",
      "source": "quic/s2n-quic-core/src/recovery/rtt_estimator.rs",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9002",
      "target_section": "section-6.1.2",
      "type": "TEST"
    },
    {
      "id": "5f02e6c590a0c6be",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 839,
      "quote": "The RECOMMENDED value of the timer granularity (kGranularity) is 1 millisecond.",
      "source": "quic/s2n-quic-core/src/recovery/rtt_estimator.rs",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9002",
      "target_section": "section-6.1.2",
      "type": "TEST"
    },
    {
      "id": "b106b2d2ed37f029",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 854,
      "quote": "To avoid declaring packets as lost too early, this time threshold MUST be set to at least the local timer granularity, as indicated by the kGranularity constant.",
      "source": "quic/s2n-quic-core/src/recovery/rtt_estimator.rs",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9002",
      "target_section": "section-6.1.2",
      "type": "TEST"
    },
    {
      "id": "315a1bdc7eb50180",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 9,
      "quote": "",
      "source": "quic/s2n-quic-core/src/recovery/sent_packets.rs",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9002",
