      "quote": "If the client IP address has changed, the server MUST adhere to the anti-amplification limit; see Section 8.",
      "source": "quic/s2n-quic-transport/src/path/mod.rs",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9000",
      "target_section": "section-8.1.4",
      "type": "TEST"
    },
    {
      "id": "ab70519a2ef4b090",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 933,
      "quote": "For the purposes of avoiding amplification prior to address validation, servers MUST count all of the payload bytes received in datagrams that are uniquely attributed to a single connection.",
      "source": "quic/s2n-quic-transport/src/path/mod.rs",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9000",
      "target_section": "section-8.1",
