      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8312",
      "target_section": "section-4.2",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "In this region, cwnd MUST be incremented by\n(W_cubic(t+RTT) - cwnd)/cwnd for each received ACK, where\nW_cubic(t+RTT) is calculated using Eq.\n",
      "id": "fa1f1ea1c5b9063b",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 11,
      "quote": "In this region, cwnd MUST be incremented by (W_cubic(t+RTT) - cwnd)/cwnd for each received ACK, where W_cubic(t+RTT) is calculated using Eq.",
      "source": "specs/www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8312/4.3.toml",
      "target_path": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8312",
      "target_section": "section-4.3",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "In this region, cwnd MUST be incremented by\n(W_cubic(t+RTT) - cwnd)/cwnd for each received ACK, where\nW_cubic(t+RTT) is calculated using Eq.\n",
      "id": "e2e52fb089f2bf91",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 21,
