            "    | Reserved-by-Protocol | False                                     |",
            "    +----------------------+-------------------------------------------+"
          ],
          "title": "IPv4 Anycast"
        },
        {
          "id": "section-8.2",
          "lines": [
            "   IANA has assigned a single IPv6 address from the 2001:0000::/23",
            "   prefix and registered it in the \"IANA IPv6 Special-Purpose Address",
            "   Registry\" [RFC6890].",
            "",
